<title>SLOVAKIA: SOCCER-SLOVAKIA BEAT MALTA 6-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SLOVAKIA BEAT MALTA 6-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia beat Malta 6-0 (halftime 3-0) in a World Cup soccer group six qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Dusan Tittel (13th minute, 81st), Julius Simon (16th), Marian Zeman (36th), Jaroslav Timko (56th), Peter Dubovsky (59th).</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,236  </p>
<p>European group six standings</p>
<p> Yugoslavia	     2   2   0   0   9   1   6</p>
<p> Slovakia		 2   2   0   0   8   1   6</p>
<p> Czech Republic	 1   1   0   0   6   0   3</p>
<p> Spain		    1   1   0   0   6   2   3</p>
<p> Faroe Islands	  3   0   0   3   4  11   0</p>
<p> Malta		    3   0   0   3   0  18   0</p>
</text>
